{"id":"2026-10-18-nature-scientists-study-special-jungle","date":"2026-10-18","topic":"nature","region":"oceania","headline":"Scientists study special jungle penguins in New Zealand","source":{"name":"The Guardian","url":"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/oct/17/secrets-of-new-zealand-fiordland-crested-penguin-tawaki"},"accent":"uk","tiers":{"t1":{"sentences":[{"text":"Researchers look at a special bird in New Zealand.","voice":"voice/2026-10-18-nature-scientists-study-special-jungle/t1-0.m4a","dur":3.59,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-18-nature-scientists-study-special-jungle/ja/t1-0.m4a","durJa":4.09,"times":[0.0,0.64,1.12,1.38,1.48,1.8,2.3,2.62,2.84]},{"text":"This water animal has bright yellow lines on its head.","voice":"voice/2026-10-18-nature-scientists-study-special-jungle/t1-1.m4a","dur":3.54,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-18-nature-scientists-study-special-jungle/ja/t1-1.m4a","durJa":4.22,"times":[0.0,0.18,0.42,0.86,1.24,1.58,2.06,2.54,2.86,3.02]},{"text":"People work hard to find the bird on an island.","voice":"voice/2026-10-18-nature-scientists-study-special-jungle/t1-2.m4a","dur":2.98,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-18-nature-scientists-study-special-jungle/ja/t1-2.m4a","durJa":4.69,"times":[0.0,0.24,0.54,0.92,1.24,1.48,1.78,2.02,2.24,2.34]},{"text":"The smart animal makes many holes to run away.","voice":"voice/2026-10-18-nature-scientists-study-special-jungle/t1-3.m4a","dur":2.98,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-18-nature-scientists-study-special-jungle/ja/t1-3.m4a","durJa":3.74,"times":[0.0,0.08,0.34,0.68,1.16,1.48,1.84,2.26,2.4]},{"text":"Scientists want to learn more about the bird group.","voice":"voice/2026-10-18-nature-scientists-study-special-jungle/t1-4.m4a","dur":3.19,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-18-nature-scientists-study-special-jungle/ja/t1-4.m4a","durJa":5.0,"times":[0.0,0.36,0.82,1.0,1.22,1.52,1.82,2.04,2.24]}],"bands":{"core1000":78,"core1800":18,"ngsl":4,"tsl":0,"nawl":0,"beyond":0}},"t2":{"sentences":[{"text":"Researchers study a special forest bird in New Zealand.","voice":"voice/2026-10-18-nature-scientists-study-special-jungle/t2-0.m4a","dur":3.95,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-18-nature-scientists-study-special-jungle/ja/t2-0.m4a","durJa":4.88,"times":[0.0,0.4,1.08,1.46,1.84,2.2,2.72,3.0,3.2]},{"text":"This clever swimmer has bright yellow marks near its eyes.","voice":"voice/2026-10-18-nature-scientists-study-special-jungle/t2-1.m4a","dur":3.91,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-18-nature-scientists-study-special-jungle/ja/t2-1.m4a","durJa":4.99,"times":[0.0,0.18,0.48,1.12,1.38,1.78,2.18,2.68,3.08,3.26]},{"text":"People worked hard for four days to catch one bird on an island.","voice":"voice/2026-10-18-nature-scientists-study-special-jungle/t2-2.m4a","dur":4.19,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-18-nature-scientists-study-special-jungle/ja/t2-2.m4a","durJa":6.08,"times":[0.0,0.26,0.48,0.88,1.16,1.44,1.82,2.2,2.4,2.78,3.18,3.4,3.54]},{"text":"The smart creature made many tunnels so it could escape from its home.","voice":"voice/2026-10-18-nature-scientists-study-special-jungle/t2-3.m4a","dur":4.16,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-18-nature-scientists-study-special-jungle/ja/t2-3.m4a","durJa":4.91,"times":[0.0,0.08,0.32,0.7,1.18,1.46,1.94,2.52,2.64,2.76,3.06,3.44,3.58]},{"text":"The team will check more animal nests to help them grow.","voice":"voice/2026-10-18-nature-scientists-study-special-jungle/t2-4.m4a","dur":3.34,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-18-nature-scientists-study-special-jungle/ja/t2-4.m4a","durJa":6.05,"times":[0.0,0.08,0.32,0.54,0.78,1.12,1.52,1.92,2.36,2.54,2.74]},{"text":"New maps show that the total population is much larger than past reports.","voice":"voice/2026-10-18-nature-scientists-study-special-jungle/t2-5.m4a","dur":5.34,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-18-nature-scientists-study-special-jungle/ja/t2-5.m4a","durJa":5.88,"times":[0.0,0.2,0.46,0.92,1.16,1.28,1.52,2.1,2.7,2.98,3.46,3.76,4.0]}],"bands":{"core1000":77,"core1800":12,"ngsl":4,"tsl":1,"nawl":3,"beyond":3}},"t3":{"sentences":[{"text":"Researchers in New Zealand are studying a special forest bird known as the tawaki.","voice":"voice/2026-10-18-nature-scientists-study-special-jungle/t3-0.m4a","dur":5.74,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-18-nature-scientists-study-special-jungle/ja/t3-0.m4a","durJa":6.68,"times":[0.0,0.48,0.96,1.18,1.52,1.94,2.36,2.68,3.06,3.48,4.02,4.44,4.86,5.0]},{"text":"This creature features bright yellow lines near its eyes and lives deep in dense trees.","voice":"voice/2026-10-18-nature-scientists-study-special-jungle/t3-1.m4a","dur":5.78,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-18-nature-scientists-study-special-jungle/ja/t3-1.m4a","durJa":7.2,"times":[0.0,0.16,0.4,0.88,1.42,1.78,2.28,2.64,2.82,3.14,3.74,3.96,4.26,4.64,4.84]},{"text":"Scientists spent four days trying to catch a female bird inside a burrow on an island.","voice":"voice/2026-10-18-nature-scientists-study-special-jungle/t3-2.m4a","dur":5.59,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-18-nature-scientists-study-special-jungle/ja/t3-2.m4a","durJa":6.46,"times":[0.0,0.38,0.9,1.34,1.68,2.14,2.34,2.54,2.72,2.94,3.5,3.96,4.18,4.58,4.82,4.92]},{"text":"The smart animal used multiple tunnels to escape from its pursuers during the study.","voice":"voice/2026-10-18-nature-scientists-study-special-jungle/t3-3.m4a","dur":4.98,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-18-nature-scientists-study-special-jungle/ja/t3-3.m4a","durJa":5.72,"times":[0.0,0.08,0.32,0.68,1.12,1.66,2.2,2.58,2.9,3.26,3.4,4.04,4.32,4.5]},{"text":"Long-term counts have mapped twelve hundred nests across nine fjords over twelve years.","voice":"voice/2026-10-18-nature-scientists-study-special-jungle/t3-4.m4a","dur":5.72,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-18-nature-scientists-study-special-jungle/ja/t3-4.m4a","durJa":7.2,"times":[0.0,0.52,0.88,1.22,1.42,1.84,2.4,2.7,3.28,3.62,4.38,4.7,4.96]},{"text":"Experts discovered that the total population is roughly three times larger than past reports suggested.","voice":"voice/2026-10-18-nature-scientists-study-special-jungle/t3-5.m4a","dur":6.37,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-18-nature-scientists-study-special-jungle/ja/t3-5.m4a","durJa":6.67,"times":[0.0,0.24,0.84,1.14,1.24,1.48,2.14,2.8,3.0,3.52,3.94,4.38,4.8,5.06,5.36]},{"text":"Before their yearly feather change, these birds make a long trip toward the southern region to feed.","voice":"voice/2026-10-18-nature-scientists-study-special-jungle/t3-6.m4a","dur":6.13,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-18-nature-scientists-study-special-jungle/ja/t3-6.m4a","durJa":7.81,"times":[0.0,0.26,0.52,0.92,1.24,2.12,2.28,2.58,2.9,3.02,3.26,3.64,4.04,4.24,4.48,4.96,5.26]}],"bands":{"core1000":66,"core1800":14,"ngsl":5,"tsl":2,"nawl":2,"beyond":11}},"t4":{"sentences":[{"text":"Scientists are studying a unique water bird known for its distinct yellow head marks and tree-living habits.","voice":"voice/2026-10-18-nature-scientists-study-special-jungle/t4-0.m4a","dur":8.04,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-18-nature-scientists-study-special-jungle/ja/t4-0.m4a","durJa":8.58,"times":[0.0,0.58,1.14,1.54,1.86,2.24,2.7,3.14,3.6,3.98,4.12,4.56,5.08,5.52,5.76,6.1,7.14]},{"text":"A research team spent four days trying to capture a female bird on an island to retrieve data from a device.","voice":"voice/2026-10-18-nature-scientists-study-special-jungle/t4-1.m4a","dur":7.37,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-18-nature-scientists-study-special-jungle/ja/t4-1.m4a","durJa":7.36,"times":[0.0,0.0,0.34,0.88,1.24,1.62,2.04,2.54,2.76,3.08,3.36,3.66,4.08,4.4,4.48,4.8,5.44,5.64,6.12,6.58,6.66]},{"text":"The smart animal avoided researchers by digging multiple escape tunnels around its underground home.","voice":"voice/2026-10-18-nature-scientists-study-special-jungle/t4-2.m4a","dur":6.51,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-18-nature-scientists-study-special-jungle/ja/t4-2.m4a","durJa":7.67,"times":[0.0,0.06,0.34,0.8,1.5,2.08,2.6,2.86,3.36,4.0,4.44,5.0,5.22,5.7]},{"text":"Over the past twelve years, twelve hundred nests have been mapped across nine fjords by the project.","voice":"voice/2026-10-18-nature-scientists-study-special-jungle/t4-3.m4a","dur":6.52,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-18-nature-scientists-study-special-jungle/ja/t4-3.m4a","durJa":7.96,"times":[0.0,0.16,0.28,0.5,0.92,1.96,2.16,2.74,3.06,3.48,3.66,3.9,4.34,4.8,5.48,5.72,5.84]},{"text":"Survey results indicate that the total population is roughly three times larger than earlier estimates suggested.","voice":"voice/2026-10-18-nature-scientists-study-special-jungle/t4-4.m4a","dur":7.17,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-18-nature-scientists-study-special-jungle/ja/t4-4.m4a","durJa":6.62,"times":[0.0,0.24,0.62,1.2,1.58,1.7,1.94,2.64,3.36,3.56,4.12,4.58,5.0,5.44,5.72,6.18]},{"text":"Unlike most related species, these birds do not breed in colonies and prefer single burrows in the rainforest.","voice":"voice/2026-10-18-nature-scientists-study-special-jungle/t4-5.m4a","dur":7.45,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-18-nature-scientists-study-special-jungle/ja/t4-5.m4a","durJa":7.51,"times":[0.0,0.22,0.56,0.98,2.18,2.34,2.64,2.96,3.2,3.54,3.82,4.12,4.84,5.12,5.56,6.24,6.5,6.58]},{"text":"Before undergoing their yearly feather change, these birds undertake a long trip toward the sub-Antarctic region to feed.","voice":"voice/2026-10-18-nature-scientists-study-special-jungle/t4-6.m4a","dur":7.76,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-18-nature-scientists-study-special-jungle/ja/t4-6.m4a","durJa":8.91,"times":[0.0,0.24,0.66,1.06,1.42,1.74,2.64,2.74,3.06,3.5,3.86,4.1,4.48,4.96,5.2,6.06,6.48,6.78]}],"bands":{"core1000":66,"core1800":13,"ngsl":8,"tsl":3,"nawl":2,"beyond":8}},"t5":{"sentences":[{"text":"Researchers in New Zealand are working to understand a unique water bird known for its distinct yellow eyebrows and forest home.","voice":"voice/2026-10-18-nature-scientists-study-special-jungle/t5-0.m4a","dur":8.62,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-18-nature-scientists-study-special-jungle/ja/t5-0.m4a","durJa":9.12,"times":[0.0,0.4,0.96,1.14,1.5,1.94,2.26,2.48,2.92,3.28,3.6,4.02,4.38,5.02,5.36,5.5,5.96,6.44,7.04,7.56,7.9]},{"text":"Catching these elusive animals proves very difficult, as shown when a team spent four days trying to corner a female on an island.","voice":"voice/2026-10-18-nature-scientists-study-special-jungle/t5-1.m4a","dur":7.96,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-18-nature-scientists-study-special-jungle/ja/t5-1.m4a","durJa":11.23,"times":[0.0,0.26,0.52,0.72,1.36,1.72,2.22,3.32,3.42,3.68,3.94,4.02,4.28,4.62,4.94,5.34,5.76,5.96,6.18,6.46,6.78,7.22,7.36]},{"text":"The smart creature successfully avoided people by digging multiple exit tunnels beneath its underground nest.","voice":"voice/2026-10-18-nature-scientists-study-special-jungle/t5-2.m4a","dur":6.62,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-18-nature-scientists-study-special-jungle/ja/t5-2.m4a","durJa":7.21,"times":[0.0,0.1,0.34,0.86,1.38,1.92,2.5,3.06,3.3,3.72,4.2,4.6,5.18,5.42,5.74]},{"text":"The project has mapped twelve hundred nests across nine fjords, revealing a population roughly three times larger than past estimates.","voice":"voice/2026-10-18-nature-scientists-study-special-jungle/t5-3.m4a","dur":8.34,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-18-nature-scientists-study-special-jungle/ja/t5-3.m4a","durJa":10.11,"times":[0.0,0.1,0.4,0.7,0.86,1.26,1.8,2.08,2.6,2.98,4.18,4.44,4.68,5.12,5.6,6.1,6.5,6.86,7.26,7.46]},{"text":"Unlike most related animals, these birds never breed in groups, choosing instead to build single burrows deep within thick rainforest areas.","voice":"voice/2026-10-18-nature-scientists-study-special-jungle/t5-4.m4a","dur":9.19,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-18-nature-scientists-study-special-jungle/ja/t5-4.m4a","durJa":10.43,"times":[0.0,0.24,0.64,0.94,2.0,2.14,2.42,2.9,3.28,3.52,4.26,4.68,5.1,5.44,5.62,5.98,6.66,7.06,7.42,7.8,8.38]},{"text":"Before undergoing their yearly feather change, these thin birds undertake a massive return trip toward the sub-Antarctic region.","voice":"voice/2026-10-18-nature-scientists-study-special-jungle/t5-5.m4a","dur":7.48,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-18-nature-scientists-study-special-jungle/ja/t5-5.m4a","durJa":8.33,"times":[0.0,0.28,0.7,1.08,1.44,1.76,2.68,2.82,3.12,3.44,3.9,4.28,4.64,5.08,5.48,5.9,6.13,6.92]},{"text":"This baffling journey makes little sense because local food supplies around the breeding area are abundant in December.","voice":"voice/2026-10-18-nature-scientists-study-special-jungle/t5-6.m4a","dur":6.55,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-18-nature-scientists-study-special-jungle/ja/t5-6.m4a","durJa":7.56,"times":[0.0,0.16,0.72,0.96,1.52,1.7,2.06,2.72,3.0,3.34,3.72,4.14,4.26,4.44,4.92,5.2,5.5,6.34]},{"text":"Experts believe the birds follow an ancient instinct to feed where other crested penguin species gather.","voice":"voice/2026-10-18-nature-scientists-study-special-jungle/t5-7.m4a","dur":6.26,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-18-nature-scientists-study-special-jungle/ja/t5-7.m4a","durJa":7.83,"times":[0.0,0.2,0.7,0.9,1.08,1.48,1.66,2.02,2.54,3.12,3.36,3.66,3.94,4.44,4.92,5.2]}],"bands":{"core1000":61,"core1800":13,"ngsl":10,"tsl":3,"nawl":3,"beyond":10}}},"glossary":[{"word":"unique","lemma":"unique","pos":"adj","ipa":"/juˈnik/","definition":"Being the only one of its kind; unlike anything else.","tiers":["t3","t4","t5"]},{"word":"capture","lemma":"capture","pos":"v","ipa":"/ˈkæp.tʃɚ/","definition":"To take someone or something into custody or control.","tiers":["t4"]},{"word":"avoid","lemma":"avoid","pos":"v","ipa":"/əˈvɔɪd/","definition":"To keep away from or stop something from happening.","tiers":["t4","t5"]},{"word":"project","lemma":"project","pos":"n","ipa":"/ˈprɑː.dʒekt/","definition":"A planned piece of work designed to find out information.","tiers":["t4","t5"]},{"word":"estimate","lemma":"estimate","pos":"n","ipa":"/ˈes.tə.mət/","definition":"A careful guess about the size, value, or cost of something.","tiers":["t4","t5"]},{"word":"supplies","lemma":"supply","pos":"n","ipa":"/səˈplaɪz/","definition":"An amount of something available to be used.","tiers":["t5"]}],"narrator":"Leda"}